# Stage 0 spike A probes (macOS, real windows; works with the screen locked):
#   RAPIDR_HOST_TRACE=1 cargo run --release --manifest-path crates/rapidr-ui-proto/Cargo.toml -- --script-file crates/rapidr-ui-proto/scripts/macos-probes.script
# Step 7 (menutrack) never returned with the screen locked: neither the
# main-queue cancelTracking nor a posted Escape reached the tracking loop.
wait 600
print --- 1. live resize: form2's right edge dragged 160 pt over 1.5 s (form2 modal, its 50 ms timer ticking)
liveresize form2 160 1500
wait 2500
print --- 2. menu key equivalent Cmd+P through AppKit + muda
cmdkey form2 p 35
wait 500
expect form2 lblResult menu: file.ping
print --- 3. async rfd (sheet created inside a pump), cancelled after 1.5 s
cancelpanels 1500
menu file.open
wait 2500
expect form2 lblResult file:
print --- 4a. blocking rfd between pumps (program code), nothing else
cancelpanels 1500
menu file.blocking
wait 2500
print --- 4b. blocking rfd between pumps, form1 resized by AppKit during it
cancelpanels 1500
poke form1 600
menu file.blocking
wait 2500
print --- 5. rfd async created between pumps (program code)
cancelpanels 1500
menu file.open_between
wait 2500
print --- 6. blocking rfd inside a winit callback, form1 poked during it
cancelpanels 1500
poke form1 600
menu file.blocking_cb
wait 2500
print --- 7. a pop-up menu tracking for 1.5 s (as a user holding a menu open)
menutrack form2 1500
wait 2500
print --- 8. done
click form2 btnDoneRight
wait 300
close form1
